### CityBite API quick tests (Visual Studio: click "Send request" above each block)
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Areas
GET {{host}}/api/areas

### Customer signup (response has devOtp in offline mode)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sana Tariq",
  "emailOrPhone": "03001234567",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Verify OTP (put the devOtp from signup here)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "03001234567",
  "code": "0000"
}

### Login (role: customer or restaurant_owner)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrPhone": "03001234567",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "customer"
}

### Who am I (paste the token from login)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Restaurant signup
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantName": "Tabaq Kitchen",
  "areaId": 3,
  "address": "Shop 4, Cantt Road",
  "emailOrPhone": "03007654321",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### ---------- Browse (no login needed) ----------

### Home (add "Authorization: Bearer ..." to get your own chips and area)
GET {{host}}/api/home

### Cuisines with food types
GET {{host}}/api/cuisines

### Search dishes
GET {{host}}/api/dishes?q=pizza&sort=top_rated

### Filter dishes (Desi + BBQ, Rs 500-1000, 4.0+)
GET {{host}}/api/dishes?cuisineIds=1&cuisineIds=2&minPrice=500&maxPrice=1000&minRating=4

### Restaurants (Explore)
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants?sort=top_rated

### Restaurant page
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants/1

### Dish page
GET {{host}}/api/dishes/1

### Dish reviews
GET {{host}}/api/dishes/1/reviews?page=1&pageSize=10

### ---------- Restaurant: bills (log in as Tabaq Kitchen 03007654321 / secret123, role restaurant_owner) ----------

### Menu for the Generate bill screen
GET {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/bill-menu
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN

### Generate bill (prices come from the database)
POST {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/bills
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableNo": 3,
  "items": [
    { "dishId": 1, "sizeId": 2, "qty": 2 },
    { "dishId": 4, "qty": 3 }
  ]
}

### Bill history
GET {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/bills
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN

### ---------- Customer: reviews (log in as Sana 03001234567 / secret123, role customer) ----------

### Enter bill code
POST {{host}}/api/reviews/redeem
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "K7M4QX" }

### Rate dishes (billItemId values come from the redeem response)
POST {{host}}/api/reviews
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billId": 193,
  "ratings": [
    { "billItemId": 1, "rating": 5, "comment": "Best karahi in town!" }
  ]
}

### My reviews (Reviews tab)
GET {{host}}/api/me/reviews
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN

### ---------- Promotions (restaurant owner) ----------

### Packages with 7 / 14 / 30 day prices
GET {{host}}/api/promotion-packages

### Start a promotion (durationDays: 7, 14 or 30)
POST {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/promotions
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "packageId": 1, "durationDays": 7 }

### My promotions with views / taps / saves
GET {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/promotions
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN

### Extend (adds days after the current run)
POST {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/promotions/1/extend
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "durationDays": 7 }

### Stop
POST {{host}}/api/my-restaurant/promotions/1/stop
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_OWNER_TOKEN
